  "Notes": "笔记",
  "Notes can include the current playback time or remain untimed. The global Notebook supports quick capture, search, editing, deletion, Markdown export, and exact timestamp return.": "笔记可附带当前播放时间，也可不带时间。全局笔记本支持快速记录、搜索、编辑、删除、Markdown 导出和精确返回时间戳。",
  "Oil-painting and watercolor studies appear here only during real podcast playback.": "油画与水彩画面只会在实际播放播客时出现在这里。",
  "Once you record completions, this distribution will reveal whether a show is quietly taking too much time.": "记录完成情况后，这一分布会显示某个栏目是否在不知不觉中占用过多时间。",
  "One-sentence summary / reusable conclusion": "一句话总结 / 可复用结论",
  "Online draft translation is unavailable; enter one manually.": "在线草稿翻译不可用，请手动填写。",
  "Only completions and skips you record in this browser on this device are counted. The initial suggested queue is not treated as listening output.": "只统计你在这台设备的此浏览器中记录的完成与跳过。初始建议队列不计为聆听成果。",
  "Only show and title are required; verify the rest later.": "只需填写栏目和标题，其余信息可稍后核实。",
  "Only that selected word goes to MyMemory for an online draft—never the whole transcript. Free shared quotas can fail or return HTTP 429, so manual entry is always available.": "只有所选单词会发送给 MyMemory 获取在线草稿，绝不发送整篇文稿。免费共享额度可能失败或返回 HTTP 429，因此始终可以手动填写。",
  "Open KimiClaw": "打开 KimiClaw",
