  "Provide the episode title, podcast name, and a public audio URL. Choose VTT or SRT when you need timestamps. Never include account tokens or private feed credentials.": "提供单集标题、播客名称和公开音频链接。需要时间戳时请选择 VTT 或 SRT。切勿包含账户令牌或私人订阅凭据。",
  "Provide the title, podcast, and a public audio link. SkopeinSignal prepares a portable request; you confirm access, processing, and file receipt in KimiClaw.": "提供标题、播客和公开音频链接。调频中 会准备可携带的请求；你需要在 KimiClaw 中确认访问、处理和文件接收情况。",
