  "READ": "阅读",
  "REVIEW / OUTPUT": "复盘 / 成果",
  "RSS and manual entry only bring candidates here. Compare guests, subjects, and information gain before admitting anything to the weekly queue.": "RSS 和手动录入只会把候选带到这里。加入每周队列前，请比较嘉宾、主题和信息增量。",
  "RSS audio streams from its host. Local audio stays in this browser’s IndexedDB and is excluded from JSON backups.": "RSS 音频从其托管方在线播放。本地音频保存在此浏览器的 IndexedDB 中，不包含在 JSON 备份内。",
  "RSS networking": "RSS 网络",
  "RSS or manual entry brought this candidate here, but no listening time has been committed. Selection still requires at least two explicit reasons and an open quota slot.": "RSS 或手动录入了这个候选，但尚未承诺任何聆听时间。选择仍需至少两个明确理由和一个可用配额。",
