  "Reset the entire workspace in this browser? Show edits, episode states, notes, and statistics will return to their initial values. This cannot be undone; export a backup first.": "要重置此浏览器中的整个工作区吗？栏目编辑、单集状态、笔记和统计数据都将恢复初始值。此操作无法撤销，请先导出备份。",
