  "Shows, episodes, transcripts, vocabulary, notes, playback positions, interface language, and settings.": "栏目、单集、文稿、词汇、笔记、播放位置、界面语言和设置。",
  "Shows, transcripts, vocabulary, notes, and playback positions are stored in localStorage. Local audio is separate in IndexedDB and excluded from JSON. Export a backup and keep original audio before clearing site data.": "栏目、文稿、词汇、笔记和播放位置存储在 localStorage 中。本地音频单独存储在 IndexedDB 中，不包含在 JSON 内。清除网站数据前，请导出备份并保留原始音频。",
  "Similarity {score}%": "相似度 {score}%",
  "Six instrument timbres are synthesized live. These are original stylistic studies, not recordings or reproductions of a composer’s works. Starting real podcast audio stops the performance.": "六种乐器音色均为实时合成。这些是原创风格练习，不是录音，也不是对作曲家作品的复现。开始播放真实播客音频会停止演奏。",
