  "SkopeinSignal prepares the request and imports the returned file; it does not transcribe audio itself.": "调频中 负责准备请求并导入返回的文件，本身不会转写音频。",
  "Snipd-exported Markdown can be imported directly. Without sentence timestamps it still supports word lookup and export, but not audio synchronization.": "可直接导入 Snipd 导出的 Markdown。没有句子时间戳时仍支持查词和导出，但不能同步音频。",
