  "Success": "成功",
  "Synchronized transcript": "同步文稿",
  "System share flow completed. Confirm receipt and processing in the destination app.": "系统分享流程已完成。请在目标应用中确认接收和处理结果。",
  "TEMPO": "速度",
  "TXT preserves clean paragraphs; a complete source timeline can also be exported as VTT subtitles.": "TXT 保留整洁段落；完整来源时间轴也可导出为 VTT 字幕。",
  "Tap Safari’s Share button.": "轻点 Safari 的“分享”按钮。",
  "The RSS URL must start with http:// or https://, or it may be left empty.": "RSS 链接必须以 http:// 或 https:// 开头，也可以留空。",
  "The app shell can open offline; RSS refresh still requires a connection.": "应用外壳可离线打开；RSS 刷新仍需网络连接。",
  "The app shell can reopen offline. RSS refresh, online draft translation, public audio streaming, and external providers still require connectivity. The interface language is independent of the podcast’s own language and can be changed in Settings.": "应用外壳可离线重新打开。RSS 刷新、在线草稿翻译、公开音频流和外部服务仍需网络。界面语言独立于播客自身语言，可在设置中更改。",
  "The audio host or transcription workflow may reject a link. If KimiClaw cannot access or process it, use a transcript you already have; do not treat an invented or unverified text as a transcript.": "音频托管方或转写流程可能拒绝链接。若 KimiClaw 无法访问或处理，请使用你已有的文稿；不要把编造或未经核实的文本当作文稿。",
  "The browser blocked clipboard access; press and hold the title to copy it manually.": "浏览器阻止了剪贴板访问；请长按标题手动复制。",
  "The episode determines key, melodic cells, pacing, and variation; your choices determine instrumentation and musical direction.": "单集决定调性、旋律细胞、节奏与变奏；你的选择决定配器和音乐方向。",
  "The listening desk alone mounts the oil-painting or watercolor-style canvas. Pause or end playback and the artwork disappears. Choose among eleven art movements during playback.": "只有听读台会挂载油画或水彩风格画布。暂停或结束播放后，画面即消失。播放时可在十一种艺术流派中选择。",
  "The music studio can synthesize six instrument timbres and six composer directions. Starting real podcast audio stops generated performance; leaving the studio also cleans it up.": "音乐工作室可合成六种乐器音色和六种作曲家风格方向。开始播放真实播客音频会停止生成演奏；离开工作室也会将其清理。",
  "The recorded skip explanation identifies redundancy. Compare the retained version in Dedupe or the activity record before restoring.": "已记录的跳过说明指出内容冗余。恢复前，请在去重或活动记录中比较保留版本。",
  "The request could not be shared. Copy or download it instead.": "请求无法分享。请改为复制或下载。",
  "The show is no longer available, so its tier role cannot be evaluated.": "栏目已不可用，因此无法评估其层级定位。",
  "Think while you listen": "边听边思考",
  "This browser cannot share text directly, so the request was downloaded instead.": "此浏览器无法直接分享文本，因此已改为下载请求。",
  "This browser could not start Web Audio. Try again after interacting with the page.": "此浏览器无法启动 Web Audio。与页面交互后请重试。",
  "This browser does not support multi-file sharing, so the KimiClaw handoff document was downloaded instead.": "此浏览器不支持多文件分享，因此已改为下载 KimiClaw 交接文档。",
  "This browser only": "仅此浏览器",
  "This does not prove there is no overlap. Rules primarily inspect titles and manual dedupe keys; you still need to judge same-guest episodes with very different titles.": "这并不能证明没有重叠。规则主要检查标题和手动去重键；同一嘉宾但标题差异很大的单集仍需你判断。",
  "This episode has no RSS audio URL. Use a local audio file instead.": "此单集没有 RSS 音频链接。请改用本地音频文件。",
