  "Duration rules: micro ≤ 30 minutes; medium > 30 and ≤ 60 minutes; long > 60 minutes. Unknown durations are treated as long until verified.": "时长规则：微型讨论 ≤30 分钟；中段分析 ＞30 且 ≤60 分钟；长访谈 ＞60 分钟。时长未知时在核实前按长访谈处理。",
