  "The default attention budget is four long interviews, seven medium episodes, and three micro discussions. Micro is ≤ 30 minutes, medium is > 30 and ≤ 60 minutes, and long is > 60 minutes; unknown durations are treated as long until verified. Change the three caps in Settings.": "默认注意力预算为四集长访谈、七集中段分析与三集微型讨论。微型讨论 ≤30 分钟，中段分析 ＞30 且 ≤60 分钟，长访谈 ＞60 分钟；时长未知时在核实前按长访谈处理。可在设置中调整三类上限。",
  "Click an episode title to open its decision explanation. You will see its show tier, recorded reasons, duration category, quota fit, and any skip or redundancy evidence. Inbox filters can isolate long, medium, or micro candidates.": "点击单集标题可打开决策解释，查看栏目层级、已记录理由、时长分类、配额适配及跳过或冗余证据。Inbox 筛选器可单独查看长访谈、中段分析或微型讨论候选。",
  "Complete with a reusable summary, or skip with a reason. Duplicate versions skipped in Dedupe do not add a downgrade signal. Open Decision history in the inbox to review completed, skipped, and archived items or restore the latter two.": "完成时留下可复用摘要，或记录理由后跳过。在 Dedupe 中跳过的重复版本不会增加降级信号。可在 Inbox 的决策历史中查看已完成、已跳过与已归档项目，并恢复后两类。",
