  "Notes can include the current playback time or remain untimed. The global Notebook supports quick capture, search, editing, deletion, Markdown export, and exact timestamp return. Send the current filtered selection to Obsidian through its official new-note URI, optionally using a Vault name and folder; opening Obsidian is not an import receipt.": "笔记可包含当前播放时间，也可不带时间。全局笔记本支持快速记录、搜索、编辑、删除、Markdown 导出与精确时间戳返回。可通过 Obsidian 官方新建笔记 URI 发送当前筛选结果，并可选填 Vault 名称与文件夹；打开 Obsidian 并不代表已收到导入回执。",
