  "(no answer)": "（未作答）",
  "Quiz graded and saved to your history.": "评分完成，已存入历史记录。",
  "Microphone access was blocked. Allow the microphone, or type the answer instead.": "麦克风访问被拒绝。请允许使用麦克风，或改为打字回答。",
  "06 · Voice quiz": "06 · 语音测试",
  "07 · Account, sharing & data": "07 · 账户、分享与数据",
  "Test what you actually understood": "检验你真正听懂了多少",
  "The voice quiz drafts comprehension questions from the episode’s own transcript and grades your spoken answers.": "语音测试从该集自己的文字稿出发拟出理解题，并为你的口头回答评分。",
  "Finish listening first.": "先听完再测。",
  "Only episodes with a listening-desk transcript appear in the picker. The quiz measures what stayed with you—set up the desk in Listen & Read before opening the quiz.": "只有建立了收听台文字稿的单集才会出现在选择列表中。测试衡量的是你听完留下的东西——请先在“听读”中建立收听台，再打开测试。",
  "Generate questions.": "生成题目。",
  "Choose three to six questions. A transcript excerpt goes to the site’s own AI, which drafts open comprehension questions with reference answers—main claim, supporting evidence, concrete details. Nothing outside the excerpt is quizzed.": "可选三到六题。文字稿片段会发送给站点自己的 AI，由它拟出开放式理解题并附参考答案——核心论点、支撑证据、具体细节。片段之外的内容不会入题。",
  "Answer out loud.": "开口回答。",
  "Tap Answer by voice and speak; browser speech recognition types your words into the answer box, where you can still edit them. On browsers without voice input, type instead. Comprehension is graded, never pronunciation or grammar.": "点按“语音回答”后开口作答；浏览器语音识别会把你的话转写进答案框，仍可手动修改。在不支持语音输入的浏览器中改为打字。评分只看理解程度，不评发音或语法。",
  "Read the grading.": "查看评分。",
  "Each answer is marked Understood, Partly understood, or Missed, with one short feedback note and the reference answer; the overall score is out of 100. Graded quizzes are saved under Past quizzes and sync with your cloud workspace.": "每道题标记为理解到位、部分理解或未抓住，附一条简短反馈与参考答案；总分以百分制计。评分后的测验保存在“历史测验”中，并随云工作区同步。",
  "Know the cost and the gate.": "了解费用与门槛。",
  "Question generation and grading are AI calls billed to the site owner, so the module requires a signed-in account and never auto-retries a failed call. If the owner’s AI quota is exhausted, the quiz says so plainly and waits.": "出题与评分都是计入站主额度的 AI 调用，因此本模块要求已登录账户，且失败的调用不会自动重试。若站主 AI 额度耗尽，测试会明确提示并等待。",
  "Open voice quiz": "打开语音测试",
  "Open listen & read": "打开听读",
  "Know what syncs, what stays local, and what sharing means": "弄清什么会同步、什么留在本地、分享意味着什么",
  "Private account sync for workspace JSON; a shareable site without shared data; no audio upload.": "工作区 JSON 的私人账户同步；站点可分享但数据不共享；音频从不上传。",
  "Sign in, step by step.": "登录步骤详解。",
  "Open My Account in the sidebar, choose Sign in with Kimi, and complete the sign-in on the Kimi page. Back on this site, the account card shows your Kimi email and creates your private cloud workspace on first sign-in—no separate password is invented or stored. Sign out anytime from the same panel.": "在侧边栏打开“我的账户”，点按“使用 Kimi 登录”，在 Kimi 页面完成登录。回到本站后，账户卡片会显示你的 Kimi 邮箱，并在首次登录时创建你的私人云工作区——这里不会另行发明或存储任何密码。随时可在同一面板退出登录。",
  "Decide the first sync direction.": "决定首次同步方向。",
  "If this device already holds work, the first sign-in asks whether to upload this device’s workspace to the cloud or start fresh. On your second iPad, sign in with the same Kimi account and the cloud workspace loads; revision checks stop an older device from silently overwriting a newer one.": "如果这台设备上已有工作成果，首次登录会询问：把本设备的工作区上传到云端，还是从全新云工作区开始。在你的第二台 iPad 上用同一个 Kimi 账户登录，云工作区便会载入；版本检查会阻止旧设备悄悄覆盖较新的成果。",
  "Share the site freely.": "站点可以自由分享。",
  "Once the site is published, its public link can be shared with anyone. A visitor opens a fresh local workspace with the default catalogue only—none of your episodes, transcripts, vocabulary, notes, or quiz history is included. To use cloud sync or the voice quiz, a visitor signs in with their own Kimi account, which creates a separate workspace bound to that account.": "站点发布后，其公开链接可以分享给任何人。访客打开的是一个只含默认目录的全新本地工作区——你的单集、文字稿、词汇、笔记和测验历史都不在其中。访客若要使用云同步或语音测试，需用自己的 Kimi 账户登录，那将创建绑定其账户的独立工作区。",
  "Sharing never touches your cloud data.": "分享不会触及你的云数据。",
  "Cloud workspace requests are authenticated and isolated per Kimi account: visitors cannot see, read, or overwrite your cloud workspace, and sign-out on any device leaves your cloud copy intact. Keep one billing caveat in mind—the voice quiz and sparks AI calls are billed to the site owner, whoever clicks the button.": "云工作区请求按 Kimi 账户逐一鉴权并隔离：访客无法看到、读取或覆盖你的云工作区，在任何设备上退出登录也不会影响云端副本。只有一点计费提醒——语音测试与灵感的 AI 调用计入站主额度，无论按下按钮的是谁。",
  "Shows, episodes, value categories, imported Kimi summaries, transcripts, vocabulary, card schedules, written notes, editable Apple Pencil strokes, quiz history, playback positions, interface language, and settings.": "节目、单集、价值分类、导入的 Kimi 摘要、文字稿、词汇、卡片进度、手写笔记、可编辑的 Apple Pencil 笔迹、测验历史、播放位置、界面语言与设置。",

  "Sparks": "灵感",
  "IDEA FEEDBACK": "想法涌现 · AI 点评",
