  "Right after an episode, write or dictate the thought that surfaced. The atelier’s AI answers with an honest evaluation, what works, and concrete next steps. AI calls are billed to the site owner, so this module requires sign-in.": "听完一集，立刻把浮现的想法写下来或口述出来。学习台的 AI 会给出诚实的评价、亮点与具体的下一步建议。AI 调用计入站主额度，因此本模块需要登录。",
