  "A PRIVATE PODCAST LEARNING ATELIER": "一座私人播客艺术舞台",
  "A quiz call sends the episode title, show name, and a transcript excerpt; grading also sends your spoken answers. A spark call sends your idea text plus, if you linked an episode, its transcript excerpt. An AI test call sends only the tested word pairs. Nothing else is attached — never your whole workspace, never audio.": "出题调用会发送单集标题、节目名称与一段文稿摘录；批改还会发送你的口头回答。灵感调用发送你的想法文本，若关联单集则附上文稿摘录。AI 组卷只发送被测的词条对。除此之外不附带任何内容——绝不发送整个工作区，绝不发送音频。",
