  "Both scholarly databases are unavailable right now. Your idea remains here; try the search again later.": "两个学术数据库暂时均不可用。你的想法仍保留在这里，请稍后再试。",
  "The live scholarly indexes returned no usable records for this query. Broaden the idea or name the mechanism you want to compare.": "实时学术索引未返回此检索词的可用记录。请扩大想法范围，或明确要比较的机制。",
  "Sign in to use Resources.": "登录后即可使用资源模式。",
  "The research request failed. Nothing was retried automatically; try again when ready.": "研究请求失败，未自动重试；请在准备好后重试。",
  "RESOURCES / LIVE SCHOLARLY EVIDENCE": "资源／实时学术证据",
  "Put the idea beside real research.": "将想法与真实研究并置。",
  "AI turns your spark into a scholarly search, retrieves live records, then compares claims and evidence. Expert views are labelled paraphrases—not quotations—and every source opens its real DOI or database page.": "AI 会将你的灵感转化为学术检索，获取实时记录，再比较论点与证据。专家观点会标注为转述而非直接引文，每条来源均可打开真实的 DOI 或数据库页面。",
  "Start from a saved spark": "从已保存的灵感开始",
