  "State the mechanism, assumption, or possibility you want to test against expert work…": "写下你希望与专家研究对照检验的机制、假设或可能性……",
  "One request uses two billable AI calls: search planning and evidence comparison. OpenAlex is tried first, with Crossref as a live fallback. Neither AI call is automatically retried.": "每次请求包含两次计费 AI 调用：检索规划与证据比较。系统先尝试 OpenAlex，失败时实时回退至 Crossref。两次 AI 调用均不会自动重试。",
