  "Recognise ink, then confirm the words.": "识别墨迹，再确认文字。",
  "In Sparks → Apple Pencil mode, Recognise this page sends a PNG of the visible ink to an image-capable site model. Check and edit the transcript before evaluation; changing the ink clears the old transcript so words and drawing cannot drift apart.": "在「灵感 → Apple Pencil 模式」中，「识别本页」会把可见墨迹的 PNG 图片发送给支持图像的站点模型。评价前请检查并编辑识别稿；修改墨迹会清除旧识别稿，避免文字与画面不一致。",
  "Practise IELTS Writing Task 2.": "练习雅思写作 Task 2。",
  "In Notes → IELTS Writing, use saved material, pasted Snipd takeaways, or an AI summary of the episode transcript. The unofficial paper has a 250-word minimum and a 40-minute timer; AI feedback covers the four writing criteria and is a practice estimate, not an IELTS result.": "在「笔记 → 雅思写作」中，可使用已保存材料、粘贴的 Snipd 要点，或 AI 对单集文稿的总结。非官方试卷要求至少 250 词，并提供 40 分钟计时；AI 反馈涵盖四项写作标准，分数仅为练习估算，不是雅思成绩。",
  "Switch to unofficial IELTS Speaking practice.": "切换到非官方雅思口语练习。",
  "Choose saved material, pasted Snipd takeaways, or an AI summary of the episode transcript. Answer six questions across Parts 1–3 by voice, then receive criterion-based practice bands. Pronunciation is not banded because only text—not audio—is assessed.": "可选择已保存材料、粘贴的 Snipd 要点，或 AI 对单集文稿的总结。用语音回答 Part 1–3 的六道题，再获得按标准评定的练习分数。由于评分只依据文字而非音频，不对发音打分。",
  "Compare a spark with live scholarly resources.": "将灵感与实时学术资源比较。",
  "Resources plans a search from your idea, tries OpenAlex then Crossref, and compares only the titles, metadata, and abstracts actually returned. Expert views are AI paraphrases with real DOI or database links; metadata-only records are labelled, and feasibility remains a cautious hypothesis rather than a conclusion. One comparison uses two billable AI calls.": "Resources 根据你的想法规划检索，先尝试 OpenAlex，再回退到 Crossref，只比较实际返回的标题、元数据和摘要。专家观点为 AI 转述，并附真实 DOI 或数据库链接；仅有元数据的记录会明确标注，实现可能性也只是审慎假设，而非结论。每次比较包含两次计费 AI 调用。",
  "Know which actions call AI.": "了解哪些操作会调用 AI。",
  "Voice quiz generation and grading, IELTS paper generation and band feedback, Spark evaluation, handwriting recognition, Resources search planning and comparison, and Word Decks → Test → AI builder use the managed site AI. Triage, dedupe, lenses, decks, local tests, notes, and playback remain local and free.": "语音测试出题与评分、雅思试卷生成与分数反馈、灵感评价、手写识别、Resources 检索规划与比较，以及「词卡 → 测试 → AI 生成」使用站点托管 AI。分流、去重、观察视角、词卡、本地测试、笔记和播放仍在本地免费运行。",
  "Quiz and IELTS calls send the episode title, relevant material or transcript excerpt, and your answers when grading. Spark evaluation sends your confirmed idea and optional episode excerpt; handwriting recognition sends a PNG of the page; Resources sends your idea to plan a search, retrieves public scholarly records, then sends those records for comparison. Your whole workspace and audio files are never attached.": "语音测试和雅思调用会发送单集标题、相关材料或文稿节选，评分时还会发送你的答案。灵感评价发送你确认的想法和可选单集节选；手写识别发送本页 PNG 图片；Resources 发送你的想法以规划检索，获取公开学术记录后再发送这些记录进行比较。绝不会附上整个工作区或音频文件。",
  "No. AI features run through the site’s own managed AI gateway; its key stays on the server and is never handed to the browser or swapped for a third-party key. The site will not ask you for a DeepSeek (or any other) private API key — that is a deliberate security choice, not a missing feature. The call paths that do exist: the managed gateway behind the AI actions listed above, and the free local paths — local test builder and grading, browser speech recognition, the on-device transcript drafter, and per-word MyMemory drafts. KimiClaw handles transcripts as a file round trip, and the help center below can hand a question to Kimi directly.": "不可以。AI 功能通过站点自有的托管 AI 网关运行，密钥只保留在服务端，不会交给浏览器，也不会替换为第三方密钥。站点不会索要你的 DeepSeek 或任何其他私有 API 密钥——这是有意的安全设计，并非功能缺失。现有路径包括上述 AI 操作背后的托管网关，以及免费本地路径：本地测试生成与评分、浏览器语音识别、设备端文稿草拟和 MyMemory 逐词草译。KimiClaw 通过文件往返处理转录，下方帮助中心也可将问题直接交给 Kimi。",
  "No. Each AI request is self-contained: it carries only the payload described above — an excerpt, your answers, a spark text, or tested word pairs — and the gateway keeps no conversation history between calls. What does persist is your own saved work: graded quizzes, spark feedback, and decks live in your workspace (and cloud copy when signed in) until you delete them yourself.": "不会。每次 AI 请求彼此独立，只携带上述内容——节选、你的答案、灵感文字或受测词对——网关不会在调用之间保留对话历史。会持续保存的是你自己的工作成果：已评分测试、灵感反馈和词卡保存在工作区（登录后还包括云端副本），直到你主动删除。",
  "The AI actions call the site’s managed gateway, which resolves its configured default model on the server side; the model name is never hardcoded into the page or exposed to the browser. There is no model picker by design — it keeps every answer on one audited, quota-controlled path. The free local paths (local test builder, on-device transcriber, browser speech recognition) use no remote model at all.": "AI 操作调用站点托管网关，由服务端解析已配置的默认模型；模型名称不会硬编码到页面中，也不会暴露给浏览器。产品有意不提供模型选择器，使所有回答都经过同一条可审计、受额度控制的路径。免费本地路径（本地测试生成、设备端转录、浏览器语音识别）完全不使用远程模型。",
