  "Short spoken answers and AI long-form questions are separate exercises, each drawing only on the episode transcript and grading your spoken response.": "短篇口语回答与 AI 长段问话是两个独立练习，均只依据单集文稿出题并评价你的口语回答。",
  "Choose Short spoken answers for concise recall.": "选择「短篇口语回答」进行简明回忆。",
  "Generate three to six self-contained questions without long transcript quotations. Answer each in one or two spoken sentences about a main claim, supporting detail, example, or cause. This mode does not ask for a developed paragraph.": "生成三至六道不引用长段原文的独立问题。围绕核心观点、支撑细节、例子或原因，用一两句话口头回答。此模式不要求展开成完整段落。",
  "Choose AI long-form questions for deeper interpretation.": "选择「AI 长段问话」进行深入阐释。",
  "Generate two to four questions. Each quotes two to four sentences verbatim from the transcript and asks you to interpret the reasoning or connect it to the episode’s broader argument. Answer with a developed spoken paragraph; this mode uses continuous recognition and lets you stop manually.": "生成两至四道问题。每题逐字引用文稿中的两至四句，要求你阐释其中推理，或将其与单集更宏观的论证联系起来。请用完整口语段落回答；此模式使用连续识别，可手动停止。",
  "LISTENING COMPREHENSION / SHORT SPOKEN ANSWERS": "听力理解／短篇口语回答",
  "LISTENING COMPREHENSION / AI LONG-FORM QUESTIONS": "听力理解／AI 长段问话",
  "Answer what stayed with you, briefly.": "简要说出你记住的内容。",
  "Take a passage into a deeper conversation.": "围绕一段原文，展开更深入的对话。",
  "Choose an English or German episode with a transcript. AI asks concise comprehension questions; answer each in one or two spoken sentences, without typing. This is the separate short-answer exercise, not the long-form interview.": "选择带有文稿的英语或德语单集。AI 提出简明理解题，每题用一两句话口头回答，无需打字。这是独立的短篇回答练习，不是长段问话。",
  "Choose an English or German episode with a transcript. AI quotes a longer passage and asks you to interpret its reasoning in a developed spoken paragraph. This is the separate long-form exercise, not the short-answer quiz.": "选择带有文稿的英语或德语单集。AI 引用较长原文，要求你用完整口语段落阐释其中推理。这是独立的长段问话练习，不是短篇回答测验。",
  "Short spoken answers": "短篇口语回答",
  "AI long-form questions": "AI 长段问话",
  "Generate short-answer questions": "生成短篇回答题",
  "Generate long-form questions": "生成长段问话题",
  "Short-answer questions use only the episode transcript excerpt and call for one or two spoken sentences. The excerpt is sent to the site’s AI; generation is never auto-retried.": "短篇回答题仅使用单集文稿节选，要求用一两句话口头回答。节选会发送至站点 AI；生成失败不会自动重试。",
  "Long-form questions quote two to four transcript sentences and call for a developed spoken paragraph. The excerpt is sent to the site’s AI; generation is never auto-retried.": "长段问话题引用文稿中的两至四句，要求用完整口语段落回答。节选会发送至站点 AI；生成失败不会自动重试。",
  "Tap Answer by voice and give a one- or two-sentence answer…": "点击「语音回答」，用一两句话作答……",
  "Tap Answer by voice and develop your interpretation in a spoken paragraph…": "点击「语音回答」，用完整口语段落展开你的阐释……",
  "Complete performance; gentle noise reduction applied; converted to MP3.": "完整演奏；已进行轻度降底噪；转换为 MP3。",
