  "Cloud workspace size": "云工作区大小",
  "Nearly full. Export a JSON backup, then remove unneeded transcripts, notes, or research reports before the next save.": "接近上限。请先导出 JSON 备份，再删除不再需要的文稿、笔记或研究报告，然后再进行下一次保存。",
