  "ACTIVITY": "动态",
  "Learning footprint": "学习足迹",
  "Every spark, note, quiz, and card review in one timeline — the loop you closed, newest first. Read-only: nothing here can be edited or deleted.": "每条灵感、笔记、测试与卡片复习汇成一条时间线——你闭合的那个循环，最新的在前。只读：这里的内容不能编辑或删除。",
  "Timeline": "时间线",
  "Filter by activity type": "按活动类型筛选",
  "All": "全部",
  "Nothing here yet. Sparks, notes, quizzes, and card reviews appear automatically as you learn.": "这里还空着。灵感、笔记、测试和卡片复习会随你的学习自动出现。",
  "Open notes": "打开笔记",
  "Browse every spark, note, quiz, and card review in one read-only timeline, filter by activity type, and jump straight back into any module.": "在一条只读时间线里浏览所有灵感、笔记、测试和卡片复习，按类型筛选，并直接跳回任意模块。",
  "Close the loop: four features, one memory": "闭合循环：四个功能，一份记忆",
  "Word Decks remember, Voice Quiz tests, Sparks think, Notes settle — and each hands its result to the next.": "词卡记住，语音测试检验，灵感思考，笔记沉淀——每一步都把结果交给下一步。",
  "Word Decks = remember.": "词卡 = 记住。",
  "The deck owns vocabulary: every marked or imported word becomes a card with a local Anki-style schedule. Its job is long-term memory of words, nothing else.": "牌组负责词汇：每个标记或导入的词都会变成一张卡，按本地 Anki 式节奏安排复习。它的职责只是把单词留在长期记忆里，别的不管。",
  "Voice Quiz = test.": "语音测试 = 检验。",
  "The quiz owns comprehension: it measures what you can say back about an episode, never pronunciation. A card test measures words; an episode quiz measures understanding.": "测试负责理解：衡量你能把一集讲回多少，从不评判发音。卡片测试量单词，剧集测试量理解。",
  "Sparks = think.": "灵感 = 思考。",
  "Sparks own ideas: the thought an episode leaves behind, plus AI evaluation, evolution stages, self-defense, and scholarly comparison. Its job is sharpening judgement, not storage.": "灵感负责想法：一集留下的那个念头，加上 AI 评价、演化阶段、自我辩护与学术对照。它的职责是磨判断力，不是存东西。",
  "Notes = settle.": "笔记 = 沉淀。",
  "Notes own sediment: timestamped listening notes, IELTS writing practice, and the handoff to Obsidian or Goodnotes. Its job is the durable record you can reread in five years.": "笔记负责沉淀：带时间戳的听读笔记、雅思写作练习，以及交给 Obsidian 或 Goodnotes 的出口。它的职责是五年后还能重读的可靠记录。",
  "Test results flow back into the deck.": "测试结果会回流到牌组。",
  "Finishing a card test updates each answered card’s schedule locally — correct advances it, wrong requeues it for today. In an episode quiz, expand any missed or partly understood question to save the word that tripped you into the deck; nothing is auto-captured.": "完成卡片测试会在本地更新每张已答卡的进度——答对前进，答错排回今天。在剧集测试里，展开任何答错或只答对一半的题目，就能把卡住你的那个词存进牌组；系统不会自动抓取。",
  "See the whole loop in Activity.": "在「活动」里看整个循环。",
  "The Activity module mixes every spark, note, quiz, and card review into one read-only timeline, so the loop you closed this week is visible at a glance. Nothing there can be edited — it is a footprint, not a desk.": "「活动」模块把每条灵感、笔记、测试与卡片复习混成一条只读时间线，这一周闭合的循环一眼可见。里面什么都不能改——那是足迹，不是书桌。",
  "Open activity": "打开动态",
  "Save a word from this question to your deck": "把这题里的词存进牌组",
  "Word": "单词",
  "Save to deck": "保存到词卡",
