  "Nothing yet": "还没有记录",
  "See the whole loop in the sidebar.": "在侧栏看整个循环。",
  "Under the module list, the Learning footprint entry expands into the four learning modules, each showing its count and latest output, so the loop you closed this week is visible at a glance. It is a read-only summary — open a module to work in it.": "模块列表下方，「学习足迹」会展开四个学习模块，各自显示数量与最新产出，这一周闭合的循环一眼可见。它是只读摘要——要动手就打开对应模块。",
  // — i18n-sync 2026-11-05: identity placeholders, translate below —
