  // — i18n-sync 2026-11-05: identity placeholders, translate below —
  "Paste the bench access token first — the server refuses anonymous jobs.": "先粘贴台架访问令牌——服务器不接受匿名任务。",
  "Transcribe on the server (better quality)": "在服务器上转写（质量更好）",
  "Server access token": "服务器访问令牌",
  "Only needed for server transcription": "仅在服务器转写时需要",
  "On-device transcription is meant for short clips (up to about 10 minutes) — it is private and free but much less accurate on long audio. The server path hears accents and names better and never keeps the file, but the audio is uploaded.": "设备内转写适合短片段（约十分钟以内）——私密、免费，但长音频准确率差很多。服务器路径对人名和口音听得更准，也不保留文件，代价是音频要上传。",
  // — i18n-sync 2026-11-05: identity placeholders, translate below —
  "Paste the access token to see server models.": "粘贴访问令牌后即可看到服务器模型。",
  "Medium is loaded and will stay resident until you drop it or restart the server.": "medium 已加载，会常驻内存，直到你释放它或重启服务器。",
  "Medium released. The file stays on disk; nothing was downloaded again.": "medium 已释放。模型文件仍在磁盘上，没有重新下载。",
  "Transcription channels": "转写通道",
  "Four ways to turn audio into text. They differ in privacy, accuracy, and how long you wait — pick per episode, not once for ever.": "四种把音频变成文字的路子。区别在隐私、准确度和等待时间——按每集情况选，不用一次定终身。",
  "On this device": "在本设备上",
  "free and private, runs in the tab, best for clips under ten minutes; the page must stay in front and awake.": "免费且私密，在标签页里跑，适合十分钟以内的片段；页面必须保持在前台并保持唤醒。",
  "Server · small": "服务器 · 小",
  "about 3× real time, always resident, the sane default for a full episode.": "约为实时的 3 倍速，始终常驻，整集转写的稳妥默认。",
  "not available on this deployment.": "此部署不可用。",
  "Server · medium": "服务器 · 中",
  "resident now: more accurate, roughly twice as slow, keeps 1.5 GB of RAM.": "当前常驻：更准，约慢一倍，占用 1.5 GB 内存。",
  "bigger and slower; it is loaded on demand and can be released again.": "更大也更慢；按需加载，之后可以再释放。",
  "Cloud AI": "云端 AI",
  "configured endpoint: {model}, fastest when you are in a hurry and privacy is acceptable.": "已配置端点：{model}，赶时间又不介意隐私时最快。",
  "not configured on this server ({detail}).": "此服务器未配置（{detail}）。",
  "Only needed for the server channels": "仅在服务器通道需要",
