  "Change interface language and visual theme, adjust weekly caps and daily RSS, export or restore JSON, inspect offline dependencies, configure the advanced proxy, install to the Home Screen, replay the entrance, and repair failed feeds.": "更改界面语言与视觉主题，调整每周配额和每日 RSS，导出或恢复 JSON，检查离线依赖，配置高级代理，安装到主屏幕，重播开场，并修复失败的订阅源。",
  "Choose a performance by instrument and work, play or pause it, seek and adjust volume, then use floating controls while browsing other modules. Warm also offers picture-book selection images; the other themes keep the same recordings without them. Episode audio takes priority.": "按乐器与作品选择演奏，播放或暂停、拖动进度并调节音量；浏览其他模块时可使用浮动控件。温暖主题还提供绘本选曲图；其他主题保留相同录音，但不显示这些附图。单集音频始终优先。",
