  "Cream-paper cheer with fourteen complete Edward Lear nonsense vignettes.": "奶油纸上的欢快，配十四幅完整爱德华·利尔谐趣小画。",
  "Deep forest colors with fourteen complete John Bauer module vignettes.": "深林配色，配十四幅完整约翰·鲍尔模块画作。",
