  "Different voices set out along different paths": "不同声音，沿不同路径出发",
  "Each selection key keeps a complete Caspar David Friedrich painting in view. The scenes follow the mood of the music; no painting is shared with another performance, with the picture-book set, or with the module introductions.": "每个选择键完整呈现一幅卡斯帕·大卫·弗里德里希的画作。画面随音乐的情绪选择；任何画作都不会与其他演奏、绘本套图或模块页头图重复。",
  "Each voice holds its own horizon.": "每个声音都有自己的地平线。",
  "Every arrival finds a perch": "每个新来的都有栖枝",
