  "Open Performance Room and browse the seven instrument rooms, then select a recording by its work and performer. Warm also provides a complete picture-book selection image for every recording; Mysterious, Contemplative, and Pure use text selection cards without those accompanying illustrations. The active work, performer, format, composer, licence, source recording, playback controls, and License details remain available in every theme.": "打开「演奏室」，浏览七个乐器分区，再按作品与演奏者选择录音。温暖主题还为每段录音提供完整的绘本选曲图；神秘、哲思与纯净主题使用文字选择卡，不显示这些附带插画。所有主题均保留当前作品、演奏者、形式、作曲家、许可、来源录音、播放控件和「许可详情」。",
  "Open Settings → Visual theme and choose Warm, Mysterious, Contemplative, or Pure. Warm is the default and preserves all original Toot & Puddle illustrations. Mysterious uses John Bauer’s Forest Dusk palette; Contemplative uses Caspar David Friedrich’s Mist Dawn palette. Each of these two themes has fourteen complete, uncropped module-header reproductions—one for every module, including Performance Room—with multilingual titles, semantic captions, artist, and source. They add no accompanying illustrations to individual recordings or artwork guides. Your selection is saved in this browser, included in workspace JSON, and synchronized with your private cloud workspace when signed in.": "打开「设置 → 视觉主题」，选择温暖、神秘、哲思或纯净。默认为温暖主题，保留全部原有《嘟嘟和巴豆》插画。神秘主题采用 John Bauer 的森林暮色配色；哲思主题采用 Caspar David Friedrich 的雾海晨光配色。这两套主题各有十四幅完整、未裁切的模块页头复制件，覆盖包括演奏室在内的全部模块，并提供多语作品名、语义文案、画家和来源；不会为具体录音或艺术作品指南新增附带插画。选择会保存在当前浏览器中，包含在工作区 JSON 内，并在登录后同步到私密云工作区。",
  "Open Settings → Visual theme and choose Warm, Mysterious, Contemplative, or Pure. Warm is the default and preserves all original Toot & Puddle illustrations. Mysterious uses a John Bauer deep-forest palette; Contemplative uses a Caspar David Friedrich mist-and-dawn palette. Each of these two themes has fourteen complete, uncropped module-header reproductions—one for every module, including Performance Room—with multilingual titles, semantic captions, artist, and source. They add no accompanying illustrations to individual recordings or artwork guides. Your selection is saved in this browser, included in workspace JSON, and synchronized with your private cloud workspace when signed in.": "打开「设置 → 视觉主题」，从温暖、神秘、沉思、纯净中选一个。温暖是默认主题，保留全部 Toot & Puddle 原版插画；神秘用 John Bauer 的深林配色；沉思用卡斯帕·大卫·弗里德里希的晨雾配色。后两个主题各含十四幅完整未裁切的模块页头复刻图——每个模块一幅，包括演奏厅——并附多语言标题、语义化图注、画家与出处。它们不会给单场演奏或画作导读另配插画。你的选择保存在本浏览器，写入工作区 JSON，登录后随私人云工作区同步。",
