  // — i18n-sync 2026-11-05: identity placeholders, translate below —
  "Listening, checked kindly.": "认真听过，也温柔地校对过。",
  "Open Settings → Visual theme and choose Warm, Contemplative, Mysterious, Whimsical, or Pure. Warm is the default and preserves all original Toot & Puddle illustrations. Mysterious uses a John Bauer deep-forest palette; Contemplative uses a Caspar David Friedrich mist-and-dawn palette; Whimsical uses Edward Lear nonsense drawings on cream paper. Each of these three themes has fourteen complete, uncropped module-header reproductions—one for every module, including Performance Room—with multilingual titles, semantic captions, artist, and source. Contemplative also pairs every recorded performance and every artwork guide with a complete, uncropped Friedrich painting chosen to match its mood, with artist, year, and source; Mysterious and Whimsical add no accompanying illustrations to individual recordings or artwork guides. Your selection is saved in this browser, included in workspace JSON, and synchronized with your private cloud workspace when signed in.": "打开「设置 → 视觉主题」，从 Warm、Contemplative、Mysterious、Whimsical、Pure 里挑一个。Warm 是默认，保留全部原版 Toot & Puddle 插画。Mysterious 用 John Bauer 的密林色调；Contemplative 用 Caspar David Friedrich 的雾与晨光；Whimsical 用 Edward Lear 的胡话线稿配奶油纸。这三套主题各配十四张完整、不裁切的模块题图——每个模块一张，包括演奏厅——带三语标题、语义说明、作者与出处。Contemplative 还让每段录音演奏、每份艺术品指南各配一幅完整不裁切的 Friedrich 油画，按情绪挑选，附作者、年份与出处；Mysterious 与 Whimsical 不给单条录音或艺术品指南配图。你的选择会存在这个浏览器里，写进工作区 JSON，登录后同步到你的私有云工作区。",
  "Pure hides every module illustration, every picture-book image attached to a performance, and every picture-book guide attached to a historical artwork. It does not remove the twenty-two recordings, playback and volume controls, historical artworks, artwork selection and details, copyright and source information, transcripts, notes, quizzes, or other learning functions. Mysterious and Whimsical likewise keep performance and artwork-guide areas text-only; Warm displays the original accompanying picture-book illustrations, and Contemplative displays its own set of Caspar David Friedrich paintings.": "Pure 会隐藏所有模块插画、每段演奏附带的绘本图，以及每件历史艺术品附带的绘本指南。它不会删掉那二十二段录音、播放与音量控制、历史艺术品、作品选择与详情、版权与出处信息、转录、笔记、测验或其他学习功能。Mysterious 与 Whimsical 同样让演奏区和艺术品指南区保持纯文字；Warm 显示原本配套的绘本插画，Contemplative 显示它自己那套 Caspar David Friedrich 油画。",
  "Eight folded lists keep this section short — open a group to browse every entry with its license and source link.": "八组折叠列表让这一节保持简短——打开任意一组，逐条查看授权与出处链接。",

